        "id": 10455,
        "name": "Trscroggs",
        "username": "Trscroggs",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/b38774/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-04T13:27:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Do I want to add the expansion into game before playing the first game? &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I know for some games you really want the expansion early beacuse it balances things that were slightly out of wack in the orignal or it adds a fun mechanic that makes the game more enjoyable. &nbsp;<span>Other expansions, however, are designed to refresh a game that people have played so many times they are starting to get tired of it or to shake up old strategies.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>Which is the GSF expansion?</span></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:41:30.332Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 2,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 10.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 10452,
        "topic_slug": "expansion-in-the-first-game",
        "display_username": "Trscroggs",
        "primary_group_name": null,
