        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I felt I had plenty to keep track of in my first game and didn&#39;t need anything new or expansion-ey complicating things. So my opinion would be to keep things simple and leave the expansion in the box until you&#39;ve gotten a few plays under your belt.&nbsp;</p>",
