      {
        "id": 105547,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-04T13:49:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The expansion really doesn't add any new layers, but it certainly makes 2 player games easier just because of the station card Reclaimator alone (flips into a ship that can engage SF ships or other Opps. Very useful).&nbsp;</p><p>The only thing the expansion adds is some station cards that will provide you with artifacts, which are a 3rd resource that some other expansion station cards can use. So if you don't buy them, nothing changes, but they are very powerful cards and well worth using.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:35:11.243Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
