        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>The expansion really doesn&#39;t add any new layers, but it certainly makes 2 player games easier just because of the station card Reclaimator alone (flips into a ship that can engage SF ships or other Opps. Very useful).&nbsp;</p><p>The only thing the expansion adds is some station cards that will provide you with artifacts, which are a 3rd resource that some other expansion station cards can use. So if you don&#39;t buy them, nothing changes, but they are very powerful cards and well worth using.</p>",
